meta {
  name: 01_RolesWithAccess
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: The roles that give access to an app can be read from its policy

    Given the app ttd/authz-bruno-testapp1 has a stored policy
    When the roles with access are requested for that app, the response is
    200 with the role codes found in the policy
    When the roles with access are requested for an app with no policy, the
    response is 404

  GET /authorization/api/v1/policies/roleswithaccess/{org}/{app} collects
  every urn:altinn:rolecode value in the subject part of the Permit rules
  of the app policy. The codes are returned as written in the policy, so
  their casing follows the policy file. Access packages, resource rights
  and the app owner (urn:altinn:org) are not included.
}
